---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "The SetupKaro Circle - Good fellas building setups | SetupKaro";
const desc = "A small community of Indian creators and freelancers building honest setups. Real budgets, real rooms, no hype.";
---
<Layout title={title} desc={desc} crumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Circle'}]}>
<main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border mt-4 p-6 sm:p-8">
<div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wide text-indigo-600">THE CIRCLE</div>
<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">Good fellas. Same dream. Real setups.</h1>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-7 max-w-xl">SetupKaro isn’t a content farm. It’s a small circle of Indian creators and freelancers setting up honest work — fair prices, real budgets, rooms with fans. No gurus, no hype, no “10x income” screams. If that’s your dream too, you belong here.</p>

<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-5 max-w-2xl">
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm"><b>Real over rich</b><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1">Post actual budgets, not dreams. ₹2397 setups welcome.</div></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm"><b>Help, don’t sell</b><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1">Answer one question for every one you ask. No DMs pitching.</div></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm"><b>Small stays small</b><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1">We grow by invitation and care, not virality. Quality over count.</div></div>
</div>

<div class="font-bold mt-8 mb-2">Founding setups</div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-5 max-w-xl">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-extrabold text-xl w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full">N</span>
<div><div class="font-bold text-sm">Noyel’s corner — ₹3,000 total</div><div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Realme phone • Boya BY-M1 • window light • ceiling fan orchestra</div></div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm leading-7 mt-3">“I record with the fan at 1, not 3. Total setup under three thousand — and it pays for itself every month. Your turn: simpler is allowed.”</p>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Next 4 wall spots are open — founding members get them.</p>

<div class="font-bold mt-8">How to join</div>
<div class="text-sm leading-7 mt-1 max-w-xl">
<p><b>1.</b> Use a tool, build something, note your real budget.</p>
<p><b>2.</b> Say hello via the <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">contact page</a> with your setup (photo + budget + one lesson).</p>
<p><b>3.</b> Best entries go on this wall. Discussion lives in our Telegram group (link drops here the day it opens).</p>
</div>

<div class="mt-6 text-sm">Tools to start: <a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Rate calculator →</a> | <a href="/tools/budget-builder" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Setup builder →</a></div>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
